Compute the KL Divergence loss.

    Refer - The `Kullback-Leibler divergence Loss
    <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kullback-Leibler_divergence>`__

    See :class:`~torch.nn.KLDivLoss` for details.

    Args:
